 G\\neq\\emptyset)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary combinatorial definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-finite.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9a25b0ac94a3598","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-intersection.md","status":"resolved","id":"fde8356a8733e94f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-intersection.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-finite.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9a25b0ac94a3598","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal G\\in[\\mathcal F]^{<\\omega}$ (finite subfamily, see [[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-finite.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9a25b0ac94a3598","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$[A]^{<\\omega}\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):\\mathrm{Finite}(B)\\}$，其中 $\\mathrm{Finite}$ 见 [[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal F\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal G\\in[\\mathcal F]^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcComb7FiniteIntersectionProperty}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"[A]^{<\\omega}\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):\\mathrm{Finite}(B